{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Looking for a Job"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Asking for Help"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Discuss factual and abstract information about common everyday or job related topics in both work and social contexts appropriate for the interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_9", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_10", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "competitive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "with a lot of competition"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I image you have experienced difficulty finding a job in this competitive field."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to write a letter about the looking for a job."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "let me assure you"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "don't worry; never fear"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let me assure you that a headhunter such as myself can be a great help in your job search. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "online presence"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " your reputation on social media"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I could help you to grow your network of contacts and give you strategies for building your online presence."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "regards"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a final closing to a formal letter"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Regards, Andrew Goldstein."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to no avail "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "without success "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My guess is that you have struggled to find interesting job postings, to no avail."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le03ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing Unfulfilled Plans: Past Perfect with Before and For"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you planned to do something and did not do it, you call this an unfulfilled plan."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Past Perfect</span> to talk about unfulfilled plans. <br/></br> The <span class=\"strong\">Past Perfect</span> expresses the idea that something did or did not occur before another action in the past. It can also show that something did or did not happen before a specific time in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example: </br></br><span class=\"italic\"> I had intended to make a presentation on careers in communications, but it was cancelled due to lack of enrolment.   </br></br>I had expected many people to participate, but they did not register in time. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the words <span class=\"italic\">before</span> and <span class=\"italic\">for</span> with the <span class=\"strong\">Past Perfect</span>.</br></br>  You use <span class=\"italic\">before</span> to refer to the more \u2018past' action (the action that happened first). </br></br><span class=\"italic\"> I had hoped to talk to her before I wrote this letter, but she appears to be very busy. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the preposition<span class=\"italic\"> for</span> to talk about how long an action lasted.  </br></br>For example:  </br></br><span class=\"italic\">I had wanted to meet a headhunter for over a month.</span>"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Modals for Expressing Necessity: Must and Mustn't"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modal <span class=\"italic\">must</span> to talk about necessity - when it is imperative that something is done."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Must </span>can sound quite serious and is most commonly used in writing. Native speakers prefer the more flexible form <span class=\"italic\">have</span> to when speaking.  </br></br> For example: </br></br><span class=\"italic\"> You must keep trying.  </br>Young people today must ask for help to secure a good job. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">must not</span> to talk about prohibited actions.  It is common to read<span class=\"italic\"> must not </span>in rules, laws and regulations."}, {"type": "text", "content": "** Pronunciation tip:  </br></br>When pronouncing the contracted form of must not (mustn't), you pronounce it as <span class=\"strong\">mussint</span>.</br> Practice saying these sentences:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">You mustn't give up on your job search.  </br>You mustn't feel alone.  </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": " You use <span class=\"italic\">need not</span> (<span class=\"italic\">needn't</span>) when you want to refer to something that is not necessary. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a letter following the correct structure. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about my past experiences helping someone find a job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give suggestions for finding a job."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Start with the date and opening salutation of a letter."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Thank the person for contacting you."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain how you can help the person."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain what you have done in the past to help people."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give suggestions about what to do next."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Conclude the letter with a final closing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a total of 150 - 200 words. Make sure you use correct spelling and punctuation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your letter aloud to a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le03ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le03ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le03ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Dear Mr. Bari,<Br/>\n<Br/>Thank you very much for your e-mail introducing yourself. Ms Sanders told me about your situation. I had hoped to talk to her before I wrote this letter, but she appears to be very busy.\n<Br/>I am most interested in helping young people who want to enter the field of communications start their career. I imagine you have experienced difficulty finding a job in this competitive field. I expect you have been through many interviews, without a great deal of success.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le03ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "My guess is that you have struggled to find interesting job postings, to no avail.   I understand all these problems. That's why the services of a headhunter are so essential for young people in today's job market.  You must keep trying. You mustn't give up on your job search.\n<Br/> Let me assure you that a headhunter such as myself can be a great help in your job search. You needn't feel alone.  Young people today need help to secure a good job.", "id": 2, "time": "27000", "image": "engenn10le03ob02re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "In addition to recommending employment opportunities, I could help you to grow your network of contacts and give you strategies for building your online presence.\nWe can set up a meeting to discuss different opportunities. <Br/>I had intended to make a presentation on careers in communications, but it was cancelled due to lack of enrolment. I had expected many people to participate, but they did not register in time.\n<Br/>Please contact my office by telephone for a follow-up meeting.\n<Br/><Br/>Regards,\n<Br/><Br/>Andrew Goldstein", "id": 3, "time": "52000", "image": "engenn10le03ob02re2img07.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can request or report facts about events or actions related to work and jobs."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about unfulfilled plans. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express necessity, duty, and advice about a work-related process.  "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you think a person looking for a job should use social media? Why or why not?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What do you think it means to have an <span class=\"italic\">online presence</span>?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Is it important to have an online presence? Why or why not?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "I had wanted to help you, but ..."}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Mr. Goldstein responds to Adam's e-mail.  Are his services <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">essential</span>?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio."}]}, {"type": "tips", "content": [{"tip_id": 0, "type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">\"Essential\"</span>  means very necessary; something you can't do without."}]}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "You must keep trying. "}]}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "engenn10le03ob02re3aud01"}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}]}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "rec", "content": ""}]}, {"type": "obj